        <p>The $131,040.00 headline is a 52-paid-week year. Unpaid time off, vacation without PTO, a seasonal gap, a slow January, comes straight off that year. The take-home cost looks bigger than the gross cost, because the weeks you lose are full-rate weeks.</p>
